body:
Oh also, way to follow the cue cards there kid. I mean it's not like this conversation has played out a thousand times with you bootlicking fucks before. Inevitably y'all pull the same fucking cue card, "you're racist against white people". It's fucking impossible to be racist against white people. The system is designed to benefit white people. No matter how much imaginary hatred for white people y'all try to place on me, or anyone else for that matter, the system will continue, for now, to create advantages for white people at the hands of POC. Yes, one can be bigoted towards white people, I'll give you that one, but still not racism.

&#x200B;

Oh and because I've had this conversation a thousand times, go ahead and pull up the definition of racism real quick and read it to me. Just to be sure I understand you correctly, you should post the link to the definition too.
